  "independent_checks": [
    "The authoritative command record, stdout, stderr, and retained LastTest.log were re-hashed. The recorded command ran from the repository root, exited 0 without timeout, and retained empty stderr.",
    "The frozen commit precedes the authoritative command by 18 seconds, HEAD still resolves to that commit, and every reviewed P12 source, test, ADR, CMake, and runner path matches the frozen tree. The later event-ledger update is not a P12 source change.",
    "The gate script performed one fresh x64 Debug target build and one CTest selection for retained G11 plus G12. Retained G11 validation ran in StaticOnly mode without a second retained rebuild, matching OWNER-002.",
    "All 21 selected native CTest entries passed: 10 retained G11 regressions and 11 G12 entries comprising six native executables and five standalone session-host commands.",
    "The end-to-end test composes ContinuityAutomation, the real ContinuityCoordinator, ForgeNativeSessionHostAdapter, WindowsNativeSessionLedger, LocalLogicalSessionTransport, and BoundedLogicalContinuationQueue. One raw provider-usage observation produces rollover and the exact completed operation, acknowledged successor, predecessor seal, active pointer, and Ready host session without an intervening operator call.",
    "The end-to-end restart path reopens the real file-backed native ledger, retains one provider binding and revision, replays the same operation through the idempotent adapter, restores the transient logical transport, schedules and dequeues one exact continuation, and leaves subsequent resume and recovery without duplicate queued work.",
    "The logical transport strictly delegates canonical document parsing to the continuity codec, cross-checks project, operation, predecessor, successor, provider, handoff, digest, and first action, and only returns acknowledgement after the bounded scheduler accepts the continuation. Exact replay is one-shot; conflicting, noncanonical, mismatched, oversized, invalid-UTF-8, cancellation, and shutdown-race paths fail closed in the adapter suite.",
    "The adapter persists Creating before provider creation and Bootstrapping plus handoff identity before bootstrap, checks exact acknowledgement bindings, caps serialized admission and remembered cancellations, and performs transport, ledger, and scheduler external operations without holding their physical state mutexes.",
    "The native ledger is schema-, revision-, checksum-, record-, document-, and authority-bound. Tests prove exact reopen, stale-writer rejection, sibling-backup recovery, corruption and size failure, cancellation/deadline behavior, and terminal shutdown. The end-to-end test confirms mission and continuation command text are absent from the persisted native ledger.",
    "The WinHTTP transport is restricted to loopback configuration and its six native cases prove exact create/bootstrap/query routes, response and chunk bounds, rate-limit and usage handling, provider cancellation, deadline/stop-token cancellation, and shutdown. This is transport evidence, not external LM Studio qualification.",
    "The versioned noexcept DLL factory is loaded through the real x64 plugin artifact, creates the adapter from injected contracts, drives create/bootstrap/acknowledgement/Ready/continuation/recovery/cancellation, and destroys and unloads cleanly. The separately built x64 executable passes manifest, health, recover, cancel-orphans, and self-test commands on this machine.",
    "All 24 retained Debug artifacts were re-hashed and exactly match the hashes printed by the authoritative gate. The sealed Forsetti tree independently remains 171 files, 723455 bytes, with its expected tree hash. The gate also retained no-Python and no-attribution checks.",
    "A separate read-only Validator reviewed the frozen source, tests, ADRs, CMake, exact G12 acceptance, command output, and artifacts after the authoritative invocation and found no remaining P12/G12 blocker. It did not rebuild, rerun tests, or invoke the validation runner."
  ],
